# Deliberate category order for the site navigation (awesome-pages).
# Static config — the docs-sync agent must never create, modify, or delete
# this file. Ordering rationale: product context first, then structure,
# then tasks, then rationale, then look-and-feel, then process, then the
# audit trail.
nav:
  - index.md
  - products
  - architecture
  - how-to
  - decisions
  - design
  - contributing
  - changelog
